         module upgrade (not just fresh install) when its containing file
         is not marked noupdate="1" (see odoo/tools/convert.py
         _tag_function). This is what makes the Chart of Accounts /
         opening balance / Customers & Vendors import re-apply every time
         this module is upgraded, not just the first time it's installed
         (post_init_hook only ever fires on install). -->
    <function model="res.company" name="_combine001_run_import"/>
</odoo>
